"""ROOT-only local historical fixture. NEVER upload any output of this file.

Prepared, not executed by its author. Original requests, clocks and validators
are not renewed. Local module namespaces receive a historical clock; stdlib
clock/process/socket objects are never monkeypatched. All simulated observations
are confined to the literal INERT output allowlist below. This cannot prove a
past/live watcher consumed routes, or admit a future native generation.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

